    <string name="title_scotland_yard_rules">Scotland Yard – Rules</string>
    <string name="rules_title_objective">Objective</string>
    <string name="rules_description_objective">• Mr. X tries to flee the detectives pursuit.\n• The detectives try to find and catch Mr. X.\n• The detectives win, if they move to the same station as Mr. X.\n• Mr. X wins, if he does not get caught until final round.</string>
    <string name="rules_title_roles">Roles</string>
    <string name="rules_description_roles">" Detectives\n • Team of up to 5 players.\n • Moves on the gameboard are visible to all players.\n • Try to surround and catch Mr. X.\n\n Mr. X\n • One player.\n • Position only visible for himself (most of the time).\n"</string>
    <string name="rules_title_movement">Movement</string>
    <string name="rules_description_movement">Players can traverse the gameboard trough:\n• Walking → short distance, widespread\n• E-Scooter → medium distance\n• Car-Sharing → long distance, limited availability\nEach station on the board has its one transport options assigned, trough which they can be reached.</string>
    <string name="rules_title_gameplay">Gameplay</string>
    <string name="rules_description_gameplay">1. Mr. X´s turn:\n• Consumes tickets (Black and Double, others are unlimited).\n• Selects station to which he wants to move.\n• Which ticket was used will be shown to the detectives.\n• Position stays mostly hidden.\nIn predetermined rounds, Mr. X\'s position gets revealed to the detectives.\n\n2. Detective\'s turn:\n• Can move concurrently.\n• Expend tickets (Walking, E-Scooter, Car-Sharing)\n• Can view the ticket use history of Mr. X.</string>
    <string name="rules_title_tickets">Tickets</string>
    <string name="rules_description_tickets">Each player has the following tickets:\n• Walking\n• E-Scooter\n• Car-Sharing\n\nSpecial tickets of Mr. X:\n• Black Ticket → transport option stays hidden\n• Double Move → take two turns in one round</string>
    <string name="rules_title_important_rules">Important Rules</string>
    <string name="rules_description_important_rules">• Detectives have no special tickets.\n• A move is only possible, if the correct ticket is available.\n</string>
    <string name="rules_title_game_over">Game Over</string>
    <string name="rules_description_game_over">A game ends, if:\n• A detective catches Mr. X → detectives win.\n• Mr. X evades capture → Mr. X wins.\n• No detective can move → Mr. X wins.</string>

